  "title": "$85K a Year Just to Take Two Free Courses?",
  "description": "Anthropic just launched Claude Corps, a fellowship that pays early-career people eighty-five thousand dollars a year to work at a nonprofit and learn to use AI on the job. No AI or coding background required, you just have to be authorized to work in the US and finish two free Anthropic courses, Claude 101 and AI Fluency, to apply. The first cohort closes July 17, 2026 and is only 100 spots.\n\n#Shorts #Claude #AI\n\nGet the Claude Corps application guide here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1fKGBJhUfR5GzSZq0_OUuTny4DcF_j05d3-ODf8uGga0/edit?usp=sharing",
